# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions. Written 2026-11-22.
> position fen 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> ucinewgame
> isready
# UCI ucinewgame/isready/readyok. The owner makes ucinewgame a no-op.
< readyok
> go
# The owner preserves the position across ucinewgame. Black has one legal move.
< bestmove h8g8
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
